## For Nigerian Founders

If you're building products in Nigeria or Africa, these formulas are especially valuable on Twitter/X — where attention spans are short and competition for the scroll is fierce. A great headline is your only shot at breaking through the noise.

**Common mistakes to avoid:**
- Don't stuff keywords — write for humans first
- Keep under 70 characters for social posts
- Use numbers — they perform 3x better
- Test emoji in headlines (works on Twitter, not LinkedIn)

